":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","review_id":"le9sqbJ_37ckcd6JXj6mOQ","date":"2021-11-09T15:55:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9535361528396606,"text_excerpt":"One of the typical tourist things to do in New Orleans is go to Cafe Du Monde for coffee and beignets. The prices are dirt cheap and they take cash only. We ordered 2 orders of cafe au lait and beignets and sat down at a table to enjoy the live jazz. It was still early so the lines weren't terribly long so we had some piece and quiet before the hubbub. We were also there on a Wednesday morning so it was slower than the Friday crowd we saw later in the week. The coffee is hot and the beignets blanketed in powdered sugar. There's nothing better than that. It's simple but delicious. I definitely recommend going early and bring cash. Enjoy the sights and sounds of the city."},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","review_id":"a1AnUcdsxhNZ4YCs9sHbyw","date":"2021-12-30T22:38:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9526749849319458,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I finally made the trip to the iconic original Café Du Monde stand right outside of Jackson Square and next to the Mississippi Riverwalk area. It's about a 10 minute walk from our hotel, we were listening to some good street music, while we waited in a long line for some coffee and beignets. Let me tell you that this place slaps, and it's worth the wait rain or shine. I regret only buying 1 order of beignets (you get 3 per order), but you know I'll be back for more -- highly considering picking some up after I get through the airport security. I did a small iced café Au lait, my husband did the small hot chocolate (totally judged him for having hot chocolate on a sunny 80 d..."},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","review_id":"-A9GokBfsah8RN5A9Ks4xQ","date":"2012-02-28T16:15:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9513415098190308,"text_excerpt":"Ask anyone who's been to NOLA where you should go and they all will say Cafe Du Monde. Now, I understand why! My group first tried to venture here during the day, but the line was easily 50 people deep. The good news is they are open 24 hours and there is no line at night. Hot chocolate and beigets make a fantastic dessert or late night splurge. Once you walk in, grab a table and a server will be with you. The prices are great. I ordered a small hot chocolate and beignets. I couldn't order my hot chocolate with skim (its premixed), which was slightly disappointing. The beignets were hot and fresh. They remind me of light, fluffy, gourmet funnel cakes. I loved them. The seating is PACKED! ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","photo_id":"5xETQjfIMfsoAfVO3tJzfw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5xETQjfIMfsoAfVO3tJzfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8716028928756714},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","photo_id":"hBd5vor9ki8qTA5xU6E5xw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/hBd5vor9ki8qTA5xU6E5xw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8600162267684937},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","photo_id":"LL5llbYRHEE0WSkgIth4Vg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LL5llbYRHEE0WSkgIth4Vg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8355349898338318},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","photo_id":"Io0jr4gEUlanuyl-L5sYSA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Io0jr4gEUlanuyl-L5sYSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8162420392036438},{"business_id":"FEXhWNCMkv22qG04E83Qjg","photo_id":"qx1HVuCQxjWtcNWrUjh6mA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qx1HVuCQxjWtcNWrUjh6mA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8022831678390503}]},"notebook_case":null}
